                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;As an &lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;administrator or business owner,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br/&gt;
I want to be able to view the audit log in the configuration admin interface to allow targeted GxP audit trail review.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Design notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

